    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb85051fced0d2be298bb282",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "去年『美国橡树大赛』的资料，都整理好了！\n我家训练员说，去年参赛的经验也想尽量跟你谈谈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "151f8d48c9310c4330f50b43b2ea28d6baf4be842ceebf04911aa1d5d4f071e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
