      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员之间，也有着满腔热枕。\n都是为了重要的赛马娘们――不再流下悔恨的泪水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980e0f39d53474d5f79697499f3a46658b7979886bf73fedcda2910250e5a7fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
